-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",430,{
[13729]="70066857\n1\tTalk to Rhúdon\tRhúdon can be found near the entrance to the mine in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale. Boradan has asked you to check on his apprentice, Rhúdon, who has been slow to return from his duties in the mine. You should talk to Rhúdon.\n2\tCollect piles of unrefined iron ore in Tingobel (total: 8)\tPiles of unrefined iron ore can be found in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale. After accidentally tipping over a mine cart, Rhúdon has asked for your help in collecting unrefined iron ore for Boradan. You should collect unrefined iron ore around Tingobel.\n3\tDeliver the unrefined iron ore to Boradan in Tingobel\tBoradan can be found in Tingobel in the Blackroot Vale. You have collected a great deal of unrefined iron ore. You should deliver it to Boradan on Rhúdon's behalf.\n4\tPick up the crate of ingots in Tingobel\tThe crate of ingots can be found near Boradan's forge in Tingobel, in the Blackroot Vale. Boradan has asked a favour of you: to bear the last, heavy crate of iron ingots to a waggon at the western end of the village. You should carry the crate of ingots to the waggon.\n5\tTalk to Boradan\tBoradan can be found in Tingobel in the Blackroot Vale. You have helped Boradan by carrying a heavy crate of ingots to the waggon in Tingobel. You should return to Boradan.\n",
[13730]="70054886\n1\tYou have been ordered to labour in the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\t\n2\tPresent yourself to Zôreth\tZôreth can be found in the dungeons of Barad-dûr. You have performed all of your duties and should now report to Zôreth.\n",
[13731]="7001C1CD\n1\tConfront shades in Audaghaim and search them for clues (total: 10)\tShades can be found in Audaghaim in the Dourstocks, just east of the Haunted Inn. You should confront shades and see if you can find anything out about why this ruined town feels so fell.\n2\tTalk to Prestadír at the Haunted Inn\tPrestadír can be found in the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks, west of Audaghaim. You should return to Prestadír with the strange tokens you collected from the shades of Audaghaim.\n",
[13732]="7004042E\n1\tTokens of Jajax can be found on Corsairs and their minions in Lothgobel in southern Lamedon. You should collect tokens that show an allegiance to Jajax.\t\n2\tCollect tokens of allegiance to Jajax (total: 12)\tTokens of Jajax can be found on Corsairs and their minions in Lothgobel in central Lamedon.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have collected a number of tokens showing that the enemies here are uniformly loyal to Jajax.\n",
[13733]="7003FC13\n1\tThe drakes must be vanquished to protect the city. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Aduial.\t\n",
[13734]="7003FC16\n1\tPlace the bait\tPlacing the bait will cause the avanc to swarm.\n2\tDefeat swarming avanc ([see journal]/20)\tThe challenge has begun. Dispatch as many avanc as you can before the time expires. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[13735]="7003FC14\n1\tClear the groups of Corsairs ([see journal]/6)\tThe corsairs must be cleared from the island.\n",
[13736]="7003FC15\n1\tSmoke signals sent ([see journal]/6)\tSending a bunch of random patterns of smoke will confuse the corsair ships.\n",
[13737]="7003FCBA\n1\tDestroy cages (total: 8)\tCages can be found on the shorelines of Tol Fennas. Dimlas asked you to free animals from cages on Tol Fennas. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.\n2\tTalk to Dimlas\tDimlas is in Dol Amroth. Dimlas will be pleased to hear you freed many animals.\n",
[13738]="7003FCAD\n1\tDefeat Corsairs at Makham Jurrar (total: 8)\tCorsairs can be found at Makham Jurrar, the lumber and shipyard camp on the north side of Tol Fennas. Glíreth asked you to venture to Makham Jurrar and disrupt the lumber camp there. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.\n2\tTalk to Glíreth\tGlíreth is in Dol Amroth. Glíreth will be pleased to hear the workforce at Makham Jurrar has been noticeably reduced.\n",
[13739]="7003FDE9\n1\tDestroy boats at Makham Jurrar (total: 4)\tBoats can be found at Makham Jurrar, the lumber and shipyard camp on the north side of Tol Fennas. Glíreth asked you to venture to Tol Fennas and destroy the boats being constructed there. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.\n2\tTalk to Glíreth\tGlíreth is in Dol Amroth. Glíreth will be pleased to hear the boats at Makham Jurrar have been destroyed.\n",
[13740]="7003FCAB\n1\tDefeat Corsairs at Makham Hosh (total: 12)\tThe Corsair hunters are at Makham Hosh, on the west side of Tol Fennas. Glíreth asked you to find a Corsair hunting camp on Tol Fennas and defeat those within. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.\n2\tTalk to Glíreth\tGlíreth is in Dol Amroth. Glíreth will be pleased to hear the Corsair hunters have been thinned.\n",
[13741]="7003FCB7\n1\tPlant seeds (total: 10)\tPlanting locations can be found all over Tol Fennas. Dimlas asked you to go to Tol Fennas and plant seeds to grow new trees. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.\n2\tTalk to Dimlas\tDimlas is in Dol Amroth. Dimlas will be pleased to hear a new crop of seeds has been planted.\n",
[13742]="7003FCB9\n1\tVenture to the the heights of Tol Fennas\tRaven eggs can be found in nests on the heights of Tol Fennas. Dimlas asked you to head to Tol Fennas and gather raven eggs. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.\n2\tEggs gathered (total: 10)\tRaven eggs can be found in nests on the heights of Tol Fennas. Dimlas asked you to head to Tol Fennas and gather raven eggs. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Dimlas\tDimlas is in Dol Amroth. Dimlas will be pleased with the number of eggs you saved.\n",
[13743]="7003FCB8\n1\tCollect snares (total: 10)\tSnares can be found on Tol Fennas. Dimlas asked you to head to Tol Fennas and remove the snares the Corsairs have placed. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.\n2\tTalk to Dimlas\tDimlas is in Dol Amroth. Dimlas will be pleased to hear some snares have been removed.\n",
[13744]="7003FCAC\n1\tDefeat and treat sick Corsairs (total: 6)\tSick Corsairs are at the Makham Hosh, the hunting camp on the west side of Tol Fennas. Glíreth asked you to defeat the sick Corsairs at the hunting camp and treat the bodies. A boat in the harbour of Dol Amroth can take you to Tol Fennas.\n2\tTalk to Glíreth\tGlíreth is in Dol Amroth. Glíreth will be pleased to hear the sick Corsairs have been cleansed.\n",
[13745]="7005D3A4\n1\tDefeat and burn the remains of bat-wights at Toll Oivas\t\n2\tDefeat and burn the remains of bat-wights at Toll Oivas (total: 12)\tBat-wights can be found within Toll Oivas in Câr Bronach. Within the caverns of Toll Oivas, servants of the Iron Crown work their foul sorcery to summon fell spirits and raise wights in service of Angmar. You should defeat and burn the remains of bat-wights.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many bat-wights in Toll Oivas in Câr Bronach.\n",
[13746]="7005D3A3\n1\tDeface rune-stones in Angmarim ritual idols at Toll Oivas\t\n2\tDeface rune-stones in Angmarim ritual idols at Toll Oivas (total: 10)\tAngmarim ritual idols can be found within Toll Oivas in Câr Bronach. Within the caverns of Toll Oivas, servants of the Iron Crown work their foul sorcery to summon fell spirits and raise wights in service of Angmar. You should deface the rune-stones set in the ritual idols of the Angmarim.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defaced many of the rune-stones in Toll Oivas and rendered them useless to the Iron Crown.\n",
[13747]="7004430A\n1\tSpeak with Tolwin\tTolwin is in the hall at Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n2\tComplete: The Search for Dúneth Continues\030Complete: Dismantling Their Efforts\030Complete: Protecting the Woods\030Complete: The Doorstep of Cair Andros\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tTolwin wishes for your help in his search for his missing mother, Dúneth. You should complete a number of tasks in Talath Anor, using the whistle to call your friend for help if you become separated.\n3\tTalk to Tolwin to dismiss him\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tYou should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[13748]="7000ACD7\n1\tBring tomb-raiders' sashes to Cannuion at Tinnudir.\030Collect tomb-raiders' sashes (total: 10)\tTomb-raiders can be found throughout Evendim. Cannuion is at Tinnudir. Cannuion has asked you to collect the tomb-raiders' sashes of allegiance and bring them to him.\n",
[13749]="7005AAB9\n1\tInvestigate the first dwarf-lord's tomb\030Investigate the second dwarf-lord's tomb\030Investigate the third dwarf-lord's tomb\030Investigate the fourth dwarf-lord's tomb\030Investigate the fifth dwarf-lord's tomb\030Investigate the sixth dwarf-lord's tomb\tAkhaldarâg is in the south-west side of the Pit of Stonejaws. Kyrstig asked you to investigate some of the tombs of dwarf-lords in the name of Longbeard scholarship.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg\tKyrstig is scouting near Akhaldarâg.\n",
[13750]="70058CF5\n1\tTravel to Annâk-khurfu\tAnnâk-khurfu can be found to the west of Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade. Nagli Want-kin has suggested that you rejoin Durin's army at the dwarf-ruins of Annâk-khurfu. You should travel to Annâk-khurfu.\n2\tFind Glóin in the old keep of Annâk-khurfu\tAnnâk-khurfu can be found to the west of Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade. You have arrived at Annâk-khurfu and you should now enter the old ruins in search of Glóin.\n3\tTalk to Glóin at Annâk-khurfu\tGlóin can be found in the war-room of Annâk-khurfu. You have found Glóin in the old keep of Annâk-khurfu. You should speak to Glóin.\n",
[13751]="70018F7E\n1\tSet fire to Orc barricades (total: 5)\tYou will find barricades to the north-west of Talan Haldir, outside the Orc camps of Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh, and Athmadhul, along the road that runs through Nanduhirion. Hadroneth has asked you to damage the permanence of the Orc camps in Nanduhirion by burning down the barricades they erect outside them.\n2\tTalk to Hadroneth\tHadroneth is on Talan Haldir, located on the banks of the Nimrodel, south-east of Nanduhirion. You have set fire to many of the Orc barricades in Nanduhirion and should report now to Hadroneth.\n",
[13752]="70040FB6\n1\tSearch the overlook to the west of Ost Lontir\030Search the overlook to the east of Ost Lontir\tOst Lontir can be found in central Belfalas. Mildir has asked you to search outside for signs of Corsairs approaching Ost Lontir.\n2\tTalk to Mildir\tMildir can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas. You have searched outside Ost Lontir and found little evidence of an impending Corsair attack.\n3\tExamine the haystack\tThe haystack can be found behind Mildir in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas. You have reported to Mildir, but now have heard a suspicious noise coming from a nearby haystack. You should investigate the haystack.\n4\tTalk to Mildir\tMildir can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas. You have found a small child in the haystack, much to Mildir's obvious dismay. You should talk to Mildir.\n",
[13753]="7002C213\n1\tDestroy fishing-nets without being seen (total: 9)\tThe fishing-nets can be found along the river-banks of northern Thinglad. You should destroy the fishing-nets without letting the fishermen from Stangard see what you are doing.\n2\tTalk to Noriel, who has joined her folk at Haldirith\tNoriel has returned to Haldirith and awaits you there. You should return to Noriel and inform her that you have destroyed the forbidden fishing-nets laid out by the trespassers from Stangard.\n",
[13754]="700375DA\n1\tCollect bandages\030Collect meat\030Collect medicine\030Collect vegetables\030Collect water\tThe Riders Four are in Edoras. Burnoth asked you aid him and his Riders as they prepare to depart Edoras.\n2\tBring the supplies you collected to Burnoth\tBurnoth is in Edoras. You should return to Burnoth and give him the supplies he requested.\n3\tComplete Shoes for the Horses\030Complete Arrows for Hutha\030Complete Armour from the Smith\tHutha, Ulf, and Léofdag are in Edoras. Burnoth asked you to help his Riders complete their preparations as well.\n4\tTalk to Burnoth\tBurnoth is in Edoras. You should return to Burnoth and let him know that you have done as he has asked.\n",
[13755]="700698A4\n1\tTalk to Yosarin at the Baths of Kadax in the Lower Ward\tThe Baths of Kadax are located to the north-east in the Lower Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.\n2\tTalk to Shêsha\tShêsha is to the south-west of the Baths of Kadax, in the Lower Ward.\n3\tBring the bag of coins to Aphila in the Fisherfold\tAphila is near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven.\n4\tCollect bug parts from arid sand-flies outside the city (total: 8)\tThe bug parts requested by Aphila can be found from arid sand-flies outside Umbar Baharbêl.\n5\tBring the bug parts to Aphila near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven\tAphila is located near the Fisherfold in the Sail-haven, waiting for you to return with the bug parts you collected.\n6\tBring the foul-smelling unguent to Shêsha in the Lower Ward\tShêsha is to the south, in the Lower Ward.\n",
[13756]="7004A8F8\n1\tDefeat spiders in the Tower of Cirith Ungol (total: 8)\tSpiders can be found lurking in the shadows of the Tower of Cirith Ungol. Lúksu has asked you to slay the small spiders that have snuck into the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many of the small spiders that made their way into the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\n",
[13757]="7006665C\n1\tDefeat spiders in Lhingroth (0/14)\tSpiders can be found in Lhingroth in the Blackroot Vale.\n2\tDefeat spiders in Lhingroth (total: 14)\tSpiders can be found in Lhingroth in the Blackroot Vale. You have discovered a number of foul spiders inhabiting the caverns of Lhingroth. You should defeat them.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of foul spiders in Lhingroth.\n",
[13758]="70062D21\n1\tDefeat dread-turtles at Gwâl Cruban (total: 10)\tGwendrian has asked you to thin the number of turtles at Gwâl Cruban. Gwâl Cruban is in northern Swanfleet.\n2\tReturn to Gwendrian\tYou should let Gwendrian know that you have thinned out the dread-turtles at Gwâl Cruban. Gwendrian is at Echad Terthas.\n",
[13759]="70009DD2\n1\tCollect Foxglove's Twine\030Collect Foxglove's Teapot\030Collect Foxglove's Wine\030Collect Foxglove's Parasol\030Collect Foxglove's Book\tFoxglove Tunnelly has given you a list of her missing items to remind you exactly what they are. Foxglove can be found near the Party Tree in the Shire. Foxglove Tunnelly would like you to find her missing items. She knows she left them somewhere in the Shire, but she doesn't know where.\n2\tReturn the five items to Foxglove Tunnelly\tHaving found all of her items, return to Foxglove Tunnelly at the Party Tree in the Shire.\n",
[13760]="7000013F\n1\tTalk to Gerebert Took\tGerebert Took is inside Esilia's house. Esilia Took thanked you for rescuing her cousin and told you that Gerebert spun an astounding tale. She recommended that you go inside and speak with him yourself.\n2\tTalk to Thain Paladin Took II\tPaladin Took, the Thain, is at the Great Smials in Tuckborough. Esilia Took sent you into her house to speak with her cousin, Gerebert. Gerebert told you a fantastic tale about a terrible tower in far away lands, where he saw a strange, robed man named Sharkey. He asked you to tell his story to the Thain.\n",
})
